    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia dikumi ne tshimue, mu ngondo muisatu, mu dituku dia kumudilu dia ngondo, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, ambila Palô, mukelenge wa Ejipitu, ne tshisumbu tshia bantu bandi ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua malu â Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bualu bua wakaleha tô ne mulu, wakatuma katongabela kau tô ne mu matutu, ne mutshima wau wakadibandisha bua bule buau; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nengufile mu bianza bia mukokeshi munene wa bisamba bia bantu, ne yeye neawenzele bu mudi bukole bua bubi buau. Nakawihata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba bende, ba mu bisamba bia bantu badi batamba kukuatshisha bakuabo buowa, nebautahe, nebaushiye. Ha mitu ha mikuna ne mu bibanda bionso matamba au neahone hanshi, ne matamba au manene nealale matshibuke mu bihonga bionso bia ha buloba. Bantu bonso ba ha buloba nebumuke mu dileshi diau bua kunyemabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyunyu yonso ya mulu neyikile ha mutshi eu udi muhone hanshi, ne nyama yonso ya mu mpata neyilue ku nsanzu yau, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua mitshi mikuabo idi hehi ne mai kayimanyi mua kudibandisha mulu, anyi kutuma tutongabela tuai mu matutu, ne bua mitshi idi mua mai kayimanyi mua kutamba mikuabo bule. Bualu bua bakahisha buonso buai bua kuluayi, bua kuhuekayimu ndondo wa buloba, munkatshi mua bukua bantu, hohamue ne badi bahueka mu Dina dia Bafue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mu dituku didiu uhueka mu Muaba wa Bafue nengashishe dilembue dia musulu muadi bualu buau, nenkande misulu yadi, misulu minene neyilekele kuenda; nengashishe Lebanona muadi bualu buau, ne mitshi yonso ya mu mpata neyitekete ne kanyinganyinga bualu buau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenzakashe ba mu bisamba bia bantu ku tshiona tshia kuhona kuau, hanawela mu Muaba wa Bafue hohamue ne badi bahueka mu Dina dia Bafue; ne mitshi yonso ya mu Edene, mitshi yonso ya mu Lebanona idi mihite buimpe, mitshi yonso idi ikoleshibua ne mai, neyisambibue mu ndondo wa buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu bisamba bia bantu nebahueke nʼau mu Muaba wa Bafue, kudi bantu badi bashihibue ku muele wa nvita; bantu aba bakadi bakuatshishi bau kabidi, bakadi bashikame mu dileshi diau munkatshi mua bisamba bikuabo, nebahuekemu kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe udi bu nganyi mu butumbi ne bunene buebe munkatshi mua mitshi ya mu Edene? Kadi neuhuekeshibue diatshimue ne mitshi ya mu Edene tô ne mu ndondo wa buloba. Neulale munkatshi mua badi kabayi batengudibue ne badi bashihibue ku muele wa nvita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebu mbualu budi bukuata Palô ne tshisumbu tshia bantu bandi. Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba nunku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
